 mowers running under Nasgrass rules. Heats run from 9:00 AM to 11:00 AM an
 d again from 2:00 PM until dark\, with fried fish dinners for sale between
  races. Proceeds go to the Milton Rotary Club\, Santa Rosa Kids House and 
 the Fair Association\, and the Santa Rosa County Extension Service adds la
 wn care and water quality tips.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: h
 ttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-srcfa-lawnmower-racing-1003.html
